### 🥰 Description of requirements

[Anthropic suggestion](https://docs.anthropic.com/claude/docs/vision#prompting-tips) It is best to prompt before each picture that this is picture 1 and that is picture 2, but in the current version, all pictures are inserted into same location.

### 🧐 Solution

Change the input box to rich text and allow image embedding.
When sending a request, use images as delimiters. Refer to the following example:
```python
message = client.messages.create(
    model="claude-3-opus-20240229",
    max_tokens=1024,
    messages=[
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Image 1:"
                },
                {
                    "type": "image",
                    "source": {
                        "type": "base64",
                        "media_type": image1_media_type,
                        "data": image1_data,
                    },
                },
                {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Image 2:"
                },
                {
                    "type": "image",
                    "source": {
                        "type": "base64",
                        "media_type": image2_media_type,
                        "data": image2_data,
                    },
                },
                {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "How are these images different?"
                }
            ],
        }
    ],
)
```

